1
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:20,680
我們曾經那麼快樂 現在卻不愛了 | wǒ-men céng-jīng nà-me kuài-lè, xiàn-zài què bù ài le | We used to be so happy, now the love is gone

2
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:23,700
我說妳這樣太扯 妳說妳不愛台客 | wǒ shuō nǐ zhè-yàng tài chě, nǐ shuō nǐ bù ài tái-kè | I said you are so ridiculous, you said you don't like Taike boys

3
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:26,540
該來的那天還是來了 我唱著哀歌 | gāi lái de nà tiān hái-shì lái le, wǒ chàng zhe āi-gē | The day has finally come, I sing a mournful song

4
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:29,290
這段感情失敗了 但我會一直在這 | zhè duàn gǎn-qíng shī-bài le, dàn wǒ huì yì-zhí zài zhè | This relationship failed, but I will always stay right here

5
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:32,400
我們像是天南和地北 截然不同的地位 | wǒ-men xiàng shì tiān-nán hé dì-běi, jié-rán bù-tóng de dì-wèi | We are worlds apart, utterly different social statuses

6
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,290
我們像是淑珍和水扁 苦撐多少的淬煉 | wǒ-men xiàng shì shū-zhēn hé shuǐ-biǎn, kǔ-chēng duō-shǎo de cuì-liàn | Like Shu-chen and Shui-bian, enduring so much trial

7
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:38,560
承諾還是無法兌現 我只能說人會變 | chéng-nuò hái-shì wú-fǎ duì-xiàn, wǒ zhǐ néng shuō rén huì biàn | Promises still broken, all I can say is people change

8
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:41,480
你也不用覺得虧欠 你要愛誰我隨便 | nǐ yě bù-yòng jué-de kuī-qiàn, nǐ yào ài shuí wǒ suí-biàn | No need to feel guilty, love whoever you want

9
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:44,740
但是我還會繼續愛妳 但在妳面前 | dàn-shì wǒ hái huì jì-xù ài nǐ, dàn zài nǐ miàn-qián | But I will keep loving you, yet in front of you

10
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:47,660
我會假裝不在意 當個工具人 | wǒ huì jiǎ-zhuāng bú zài-yì, dāng ge gōng-jù-rén | I will pretend not to care, being your handyman tool

11
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:53,210
二十四小時待機 不怕我寵壞妳 | èr-shí-sì xiǎo-shí dài-jī, bù pà wǒ chǒng huài nǐ | On standby 24 hours, never afraid of spoiling you rotten

12
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:58,890
對不起我騙了妳 捲菸的菸草不來自後山 | duì-bu-qǐ wǒ piàn le nǐ, juǎn-yān de yān-cǎo bù lái-zì hòu-shān | I'm sorry I lied to you, the tobacco doesn't come from the mountains

13
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:04,820
戒不掉菸 戒不掉妳 該怎麼辦 | jiè bú diào yān, jiè bú diào nǐ, gāi zěn-me bàn | Can't quit smoking, can't quit you, what should I do?

14
00:01:04,820 --> 00:01:10,960
妳轉身 離開我 我知道是我活該 | nǐ zhuǎn-shēn lí-kāi wǒ, wǒ zhī-dào shì wǒ huó-gāi | You turn and leave me, I know I deserve this

15
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:20,500
捲菸捲走我的愛 我的愛 | juǎn-yān juǎn zǒu wǒ de ài, wǒ de ài | The rolled cigarette blew my love away, my love

16
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:23,240
上了大學玩了樂團 交了壞朋友 | shàng le dà-xué wán le yuè-tuán, jiāo le huài péng-yǒu | Went to college, played in a band, made bad friends

17
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:26,380
崇拜金錢崇拜權利 也崇拜成就 | chóng-bài jīn-qián chóng-bài quán-lì, yě chóng-bài chéng-jiù | Worshipping money, worshipping power, worshipping success

18
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:29,370
白天練團晚上夜店 我都待很久 | bái-tiān liàn-tuán wǎn-shang yè-diàn, wǒ dōu dāi hěn jiǔ | Rehearsing by day, clubbing by night, staying out late

19
00:01:29,370 --> 00:01:32,350
忘了自己忘了初衷 誰能來拯救 | wàng le zì-jǐ wàng le chū-zhōng, shuí néng lái zhěng-jiù | Forgot who I was, forgot my roots, who can save me?

20
00:01:32,350 --> 00:01:35,330
迷途的羔羊 每天我照樣 | mí-tú de gāo-yáng, měi-tiān wǒ zhào-yàng | A lost sheep, yet every day I carry on the same

21
00:01:35,330 --> 00:01:38,460
少了妳好像 白天少了朝陽 | shǎo le nǐ hǎo-xiàng, bái-tiān shǎo le zhāo-yáng | Missing you is like daylight missing the morning sun

22
00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:47,480
好想變回那個屁孩只會尻槍 而不是獨自翱翔 | hǎo xiǎng biàn huí nà ge pì-hái zhǐ huì khau-tshiang, ér bú shì dú-zì áo-xiáng | Long to be that kid who just jacked off, instead of soaring all alone

23
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:56,010
好想 翱翔 | hǎo xiǎng áo-xiáng | Longing to soar freely

24
00:01:56,010 --> 00:02:01,910
對不起我騙了妳 捲菸的菸草不來自後山 | duì-bu-qǐ wǒ piàn le nǐ, juǎn-yān de yān-cǎo bù lái-zì hòu-shān | I'm sorry I lied to you, the tobacco doesn't come from the mountains

25
00:02:01,910 --> 00:02:08,130
